    "body": "Another potential benefit of changing when rowgroup headers go into the headers list would be the opportunity to place some kind of marker in the headers list (maybe something like `<>` that indicates the end of row headers and the beginning of col headers. That would be more in line with how screen readers work: They generally list the row headers for a cell or the col headers for a cell, not both. ",
